## Proposed Changes

### Bug Fixes (Logic & Runtime)

#### [MODIFY] [BootGuard.tsx](file:///wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/components/layout/BootGuard.tsx)

**Bug #1: Permanent blank screen when Supabase user exists but has no DB row**
- Line 28: [setLoading(false)](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/stores/useGameStore.ts#149-150) is only called inside `if (authUser)` → `if (user)`. If a Supabase-authenticated user has no DB row yet (e.g., just signed up), `loading` never becomes `false`.
- **Fix**: Move [setLoading(false)](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/stores/useGameStore.ts#149-150) to a `finally` block or ensure all code paths set it.

---

#### [MODIFY] [supabaseDB.ts](file:///wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/services/supabaseDB.ts)

**Bug #2: Trailing spaces in realtime channel subscription**
- Line 382: `` `channel - ${channelId} ` `` has a trailing space in the channel name.
- Line 389: `` `channel_id = eq.${channelId} ` `` has a trailing space in the filter string.
- **Impact**: Realtime subscriptions silently fail to match any channel.
- **Fix**: Remove trailing spaces from both template literals.

---

#### [MODIFY] [useGameStore.ts](file:///wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/stores/useGameStore.ts)

**Bug #3: [persistToDB](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/stores/useGameStore.ts#292-301) passes `user?.id` (which could be undefined) to [saveMessages](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/services/supabaseDB.ts#117-140)/[saveQuests](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/services/localDB.ts#67-70)/[saveJournals](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/services/supabaseDB.ts#282-303)**
- Lines 296-298: `user?.id` could be `undefined`, but the Supabase save functions need a valid `userId` string to write correctly. If `user` is null, the functions fall through to localDB — but messages/quests/journal arrays get saved to localDB even when `user` is null, which is likely unintended.
- **Fix**: Guard the entire persist block with `if (!user) return;` early.

**Bug #4: [sendMessage](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/stores/useGameStore.ts#152-227) captures stale `messages` from closure**
- Line 153: `const { messages } = get();` captures messages at call time, but [addMessage](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/stores/useGameStore.ts#66-74) mutates state synchronously before the API call. The `context` sent to the API doesn't include the user's message.
- **Fix**: Retrieve `messages` via [get()](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/services/localDB.ts#43-47) after calling [addMessage](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/stores/useGameStore.ts#66-74).

---

#### [MODIFY] [localDB.ts](file:///wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/services/localDB.ts)

**Bug #5: [exportSave](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/services/localDB.ts#106-114) uses `Record<string, any>` (TS strict violation)**
- Line 108: Uses `any` type without an eslint-disable comment, which will fail the strict `noUnusedLocals` + ESLint `@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any` check.
- **Fix**: Add `// eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any` or use `unknown`.

---

#### [MODIFY] [MainLayout.tsx](file:///wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/components/layout/MainLayout.tsx)

**Bug #6: `useEffect` dependency on `user` object reference causes infinite re-runs**
- Line 80: `[user, addEvent, removeEvent]` — `user` is an object, changing on every Zustand update, triggering this effect to re-run constantly (re-subscribing to Supabase channel or resetting the interval).
- **Fix**: Use `user?.id` and `user?.currentSector` as dependencies instead of the entire object.

**Bug #7: Missing ambient volume dependency**
- Line 39: The ambient audio effect depends on `user?.settings?.ambientEnabled` and `user?.faction` but doesn't include `user?.settings?.ambientVolume`. Changing volume on the Settings page won't take effect until the component remounts.
- **Fix**: Add `user?.settings?.ambientVolume` to the dependency array.

---

#### [MODIFY] [client.ts](file:///wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/services/client.ts)

**Bug #8: `ApiClient.isAvailable()` doesn't consider Supabase**
- Line 49-51: [isAvailable()](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/services/client.ts#49-52) only checks `this.isConfigured` (GAS endpoint), but [chat()](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/services/client.ts#107-121) prioritizes Supabase edge functions. So [isAvailable()](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/services/client.ts#49-52) returns `false` when only Supabase is configured (no GAS endpoint), causing the UI to show `[GRID: LOCAL]` even when Supabase is fully functional.
- **Fix**: Return `this.isConfigured || isSupabaseConfigured`.

